            text "SUBQUERY"
            text "CORRELATED SCALAR SUBQUERY 1"
          text "Subquery 1 returns a single value and is correlated — it references columns from the outer query, so it must be re-run for every candidate row of the outer query. Inside a scan of a large table this..."
